# Project context

> The primary project context for this repo is in `AGENTS.md` at the repo root.
> Please read that file first for project overview, tech stack, conventions,
> and active work tracking.

## Cursor-specific notes

- Use `@AGENTS.md` to reference the main project context in any prompt
- Use `@codebase` for semantic search across the project
- Spec Kit artifacts (when used) are in `.specify/specs/`
- `.cursorignore` is configured to exclude generated files from codebase indexing
- Plans for in-flight work are in `.ai/plans/YYYYMMDD_branch-name/PLAN.md`
  where the folder name matches the current git branch
- Use `@.ai/plans/README.md` to see the index of active and completed work
- Use `@.ai/plans/PLAN_TEMPLATE.md` or `@.ai/plans/OUTCOME_TEMPLATE.md` as
  scaffolds when creating new plan files
